# Ten for ten. Deliberately NOT ignored: the audio and the manifest are
# committed, so that CI can build a deploy with the music in it. That is a
# considered trade - this repo is public for free Pages, so the recordings and
# her lyrics are downloadable by anyone who finds it. Chosen over a private
# companion repo because it needs no PAT, no second repo and no 48KB secret,
# and it lifts the cap on how much lyric text the manifest can carry.
#
# public/photos/ below is a different matter and stays ignored - see the note.

# The photographs, for the same two reasons: they are pictures of her, and the
# repo has to be public. photos.example.json is the committed template.
public/photos/*
!public/photos/photos.example.json

# Design references dropped in for Claude to look at. Large, and not something
# a public repo needs to carry.
Reference Video/
